[{"title":"恭谒曾祖朝议公墓","author":"缪公恩","text":"水绕柴河堡，山开一面城。\n银冈分脉结，金体众峰呈。\n泽衍衣冠冑，心悲风木声。\n十年期展拜，此日遂乌情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12460,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁岭东山道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"山谷绕奇胜，清幽慰旅行。\n云从车下起，田向树头耕。\n石栈低天影，烟林出水声。\n卜居知未遂，吟望有馀情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12461,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭谒高祖武翼公墓","author":"缪公恩","text":"佳城临塞地，郁郁近边垠。\n云气滋灵草，山君守墓门。\n千年开吉兆，五叶拜元孙。\n惭愧承先德，瞻依欲断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12462,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清河道中","author":"缪公恩","text":"万山环合翠岚浮，策马斜阳古挹楼。\n峰辟关门天一线，浪翻峡口水双流。\n寒烟漠漠村墟暮，野港萧萧芦荻秋。\n回望凤城何处是，西南翘首白云头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12463,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绿牡丹","author":"缪公恩","text":"东风拂槛一枝春，移赠秋芳号转真。\n能傲严霜贞晚节，前身合是堕楼人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12464,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"粉红莲","author":"缪公恩","text":"亭亭独立对西风，不比凌波坠粉红。\n莫道莲花最高洁，清香合与晚香同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12465,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万花魁","author":"缪公恩","text":"共道梅花万卉魁，秋魁篱菊胜江梅。\n如何烂漫西风里，不向群芳顶上开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12466,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"满天星","author":"缪公恩","text":"霜天月黑倍昭然，分野从来应地躔。\n不是寒香侵座右，几疑星斗落阶前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12467,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邓州黄","author":"缪公恩","text":"金蕊初开玉露凉，百花洲上点秋光。\n范公遗谱知多少，应共香橙一色黄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12468,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"洋红","author":"缪公恩","text":"谁碾朱砂拥菊丛，丹葩和露绽西风。\n一从番舶来中土，赢得扶桑晓日红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12469,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"粉针","author":"缪公恩","text":"移得秋英傍绣床，鸳鸯剌罢理残妆。\n误将腻粉黏针线，挑出花心瓣瓣长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12470,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镜中菊影 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"谁移篱菊近妆台，高捲珠帘宝扇开。\n瘦影尽教归朗照，秋光收入座中来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12471,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镜中菊影 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"不让金波灿夜华，清光澄澈映寒葩。\n暂移月里中秋桂，添得霜前九日花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12472,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镜中菊影 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"几枝错落秋花影，一片虚明玉镜光。\n纵使鉴形能取象，空教写照不分香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12473,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镜中菊影 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"花临宝镜空非色，镜锁秋英色未空。\n真假尽缘心作幻，倩谁勘破有无中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12474,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镫下菊影 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"移将篱菊避霜风，掩映萧斋烛爓红。\n瘦影不须秋水照，清标收入素屏中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12475,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镫下菊影 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"轩窗深锁绝风尘，菊对秋镫影倍真。\n最是一枝斜更好，何人泼墨为传神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12476,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镫下菊影 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"最怜镫下影偏幽，一榻寒香四壁秋。\n欲写芳标留玉版，聊将斑管学双钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12477,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镫下菊影 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"秋英争向纸屏开，水月空花惹浪猜。\n已悟无生庄叟意，有形都自幻中来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12478,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆送别唐友梅","author":"缪公恩","text":"忆昔离亭日，骊歌酒半阑。\n乾坤双鬓冷，风雪一身单。\n羸马关山远，长途岁月残。\n谁知成死别，吟望泪阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12479,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"樵径","author":"缪公恩","text":"踏破苍苔古木阴，腰斤日日入幽岑。\n几多城市炊烟处，荷担谁怜径路深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12480,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"樽酒慰离颜","author":"缪公恩","text":"预拟倾尊酒，相期客子还。\n休忘他日醉，记取去时颜。\n萍水踪难定，风霜鬓莫斑。\n何年成慰藉，痛饮对刀环。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12481,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刘守愚先生自海上得奇石因纪古风八韵余既次和未尽所言复为长歌","author":"缪公恩","text":"混沌既凿开㟏岈，不周山倒愁女娲。\n伟绩奏成馀残块，棋布山巅或水涯。\n闾山趾有补天石，此石眷属应一家。\n谁知沦落在海澨，沐日浴月葆精华。\n天风海涛作知己，藉以芳草见烟霞。\n天生灵物岂终隐，不使万古埋泥沙。\n我有父执刘守愚，读书博物为通儒。\n暂去司铎驻锦水，遂以捧檄勘海隅。\n平生好奇惯搜剔，披检荆棘穷崎岖。\n忽得此石拜且舞，呼兄呼丈载以车。\n古苔斑剥土花润，鹧鸪点閒龙文纡。\n秦皇鞭迹殷馀血，望夫粉黛娇模糊。\n形质兼备瘦皱透，上皇山石恐不如。\n忆昔汗漫杭一苇，半在吴头半楚尾。\n金焦北固峙海门，烛目怪石比比是。\n猛兽奇鬼相攫拿，片云孤帆欲飞起。\n泗滨石磬设堂皇，灵壁砚山置棐几。\n少年弃掷不知惜，念言回首徒然耳。\n今读君诗忽神王，赓以短章意未畅。\n更因海峤忆经游，廿年尘迹空惆怅。\n羡君得石良足多，神毫濡墨为长歌。\n胸无灵珠吻复拙，石乎石乎当奈何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12482,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿塔湾","author":"缪公恩","text":"倚枕挑镫梦不成，寒鸡啼月夜三更。\n思亲怀友情多少，才是消魂第一程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12483,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"医无闾山","author":"缪公恩","text":"幽并开巨镇，封置自尧年。\n雄气平吞海，危峰欲柱天。\n雪凝流冷翠，岚重带晴烟。\n未遂登临愿，停骖吊昔贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12484,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿雄县","author":"缪公恩","text":"易水萧萧白日凉，飞桥十二断虹长。\n思亲一夜关山梦，半在淮阳半沈阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12485,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过易水","author":"缪公恩","text":"一剑寻仇计本疏，空将督亢入秦都。\n于期刎颈田光死，不信荆卿不丈夫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12486,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"臧家桥","author":"缪公恩","text":"淡烟轻雾锁长河，寒水流澌不起波。\n晓色离离乡梦醒，风吹残月渡滹沱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12487,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过德州","author":"缪公恩","text":"雅雨天才本擅场，一肩风月继渔洋。\n如何不悟焚身祸，有客停车泪满裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12488,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"平原吊颜鲁公 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"扑面风沙欲断魂，驱车独出古平原。\n鲁公祠宇知何处，衰草连天日影昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12489,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"平原吊颜鲁公 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"不愧先贤不愧儒，更将馀技妙操觚。\n几多蔓草荒烟里，金石遗文尚有无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12490,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过齐长城","author":"缪公恩","text":"绵亘山川一带长，萧条断垒锁残阳。\n已经作俑开秦祸，空使千秋罪始皇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12491,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦洪大亮吉忆旧时同出此途感吟二首 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"故人旌节驻黔中，十八年来事不同。\n今日重行黄叶路，愁人依旧白杨风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12492,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦洪大亮吉忆旧时同出此途感吟二首 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"万里何缘入梦中，照人颜色旧时同。\n醒来不是当年事，寒气侵衣起朔风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12493,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诸葛武侯故里","author":"缪公恩","text":"大书深刻著荣名，灭魏吞吴恨未成。\n沂水萧萧愁不断，我来何处拜先生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12494,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过宿迁感怀二首 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"河上重经感昔时，伤心世事一人知。\n先生久赴琼楼召，尚有遗民颂口碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12495,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过宿迁感怀二首 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"五载香销痛别鸾，墓门草断碧烟寒。\n不知同在重泉下，可是人间见面难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12496,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜晴","author":"缪公恩","text":"濛濛如雾复如烟，滴沥声中夜不眠。\n忽被北风收拾去，碧空云净月当天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12497,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舣舟亭","author":"缪公恩","text":"此地曾经访大苏，舣舟亭下夜舟孤。\n重来哽咽髫年事，不为重慈作杖扶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12498,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅","author":"缪公恩","text":"自挟冰霜气，何须珠玉词。\n水边篱落后，无复擅场诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甓社湖感怀","author":"缪公恩","text":"片帆曾挂甓湖烟，五两风轻荡画船。\n负笈有书空饱蠹，垂云无翼可摩天。\n相如近日常多病，叔宝当时最少年。\n细认遗踪何处是，半篙春水绿依然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镜中梅次张力庵韵","author":"缪公恩","text":"馀雪侵窗独闭门，盆梅奁镜对黄昏。\n十分皎洁涵清照，一片虚灵浸冷魂。\n姑射琼姿奔月窟，汉妃珠影落江村。\n传神已是含全像，莫认残妆半面痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登高邮西城楼","author":"缪公恩","text":"缥缈春波接远天，高楼长眺独萧然。\n依依树影留残月，点点村炊上晚烟。\n此地维舟廿九载，当时垂发十三年。\n东风依旧吹杨柳，俯仰青衫祇自怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画","author":"缪公恩","text":"家山好处正依稀，蝴蝶空劳梦里飞。\n孤负草堂春树绿，落花啼鸟未曾归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦邮寓中绝句 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"红破榴花日正长，北窗风至作微凉。\n翩翩燕子来何处，知啄香泥绕旧梁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦邮寓中绝句 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"难将好梦慰乡情，卧暖桃笙梦不成。\n何处兰舟双画橹，咿呀声里客魂惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12505,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦邮寓中绝句 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"翘首西楼月又生，蛾眉七度对离情。\n不知此夜纤纤影，照到征人第几程。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张力庵崇川花谱吟 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"笔花灿烂墨花香，写出金钗十二行。\n蠡卖窗明眠未起，不知晓梦为谁忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张力庵崇川花谱吟 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"旧事吟成枉断肠，平生我不诩情长。\n东风不管花开落，芳草连天自夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登文游台","author":"缪公恩","text":"徙倚高台暮，凭栏忆昔贤。\n风流皆绝代，身世正萧然。\n虚阁下残照，平湖澄远天。\n徘徊未归去，镫火破疏烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"露筋祠","author":"缪公恩","text":"祠树集昏鸦，平湖没晚霞。\n野风何处起，吹落白莲花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜抵维扬","author":"缪公恩","text":"水映蓬窗夜气凉，邗江古岸泊舟航。\n玉箫风静吹明月，粉堞烟深绕绿杨。\n跨鹤已成他日梦，寻花非复少年场。\n星星萤火沾清露，欲问雷塘事渺茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游平山","author":"缪公恩","text":"维扬称钜丽，今古竞繁华。\n绿水飞兰桨，垂杨隐钿车。\n绮罗春拾翠，镫火醉评花。\n十里平山路，香风处处赊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓜州阻风忆贾丈汉庭 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"风捲江湖海逆流，弄风蛟蜃上涛头。\n篷窗屏息何曾寐，渔火光中一夜愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓜州阻风忆贾丈汉庭 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"二十年前访荜门，春风携我锦春园。\n只今宿草无人问，何处冬青锁断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游灵岩山归作","author":"缪公恩","text":"塔挂残阳欲暮天，灵岩支港泛归船。\n回头却顾经行处，云际钟声破晚烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄河待渡值重阳","author":"缪公恩","text":"待济长河古驿旁，舆夫报我是重阳。\n人争野渡秋烟冷，目极平沙岸草荒。\n小市漫沽村酒薄，颓垣也有菊花香。\n长堤谁是登高伴，滚滚洪流望渺茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登岱 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"奉阴碑左独停骖，身向天关试一探。\n峰顶晴光留夕照，城头寒色压秋岚。\n登临不为风尘倦，山水从来梦寐眈。\n只忆白云亲舍远，回肠东北更东南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登岱 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"岱麓经过忆昔年，跻攀今日秉心虔。\n生成功继乾坤后，典礼尊居岳渎先。\n鸟道已经离世界，石门犹是倚云天。\n杜陵诗句裁零锦，大笔摩崖处处镌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登岱 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"五更沧海吐明蟾，杖策登云过水帘。\n辇道旧传排御幛，神坛曾见出金奁。\n碑铜蚀雨生苔蕊，瓦铁翻风堕殿檐。\n应是最高寒亦重，山人习久不知嫌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登岱 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"作镇青齐控九区，丹梯万级入云衢。\n东西日月窥浮没，远近龟蒙效拜趋。\n笔力未能摇五岳，目光安敢望三吴。\n到来天下真知小，大地苍茫似有无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无字碑","author":"缪公恩","text":"仅有丰碑表泰山，更无人迹在人寰。\n多缘事出焚书后，不欲文章著世间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"策马来思雪作花，归途秋色上蒹葭。\n应知老母凝眸处，望断征鸿望暮霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"欲济无舟可奈何，倚闾宁卜事蹉跎。\n不知衣上来时线，可及思儿泪点多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"途中 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"踟蹰病马倦西风，扑面尘沙捲断蓬。\n岁月销磨魂梦里，心情黯淡别离中。\n远山漠漠秋云冷，古木萧萧落照红。\n行道无人能缩地，举头天际羡飞鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中晤洪稚存即留别 其一","author":"缪公恩","text":"忆别何期十九年，愁肠几度梦魂牵。\n谁知意外停征马，恰得京华续旧缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中晤洪稚存即留别 其二","author":"缪公恩","text":"太液池莲问酒楼，凉风吹柳正新秋。\n即今人事升沈异，同是萧萧欲白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中晤洪稚存即留别 其三","author":"缪公恩","text":"当时妄念未能酬，罔自风尘逐道周。\n君有雄文应寿世，我将骥附亦千秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都中晤洪稚存即留别 其四","author":"缪公恩","text":"一尊清酒又骊歌，此后相思更奈何。\n海内比邻知己在，天涯万里不嫌多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅邸","author":"缪公恩","text":"黯黯孤檠冷不明，拂衣秣马待鸡声。\n无端最是疏林叶，底事萧萧彻夜鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日漫成","author":"缪公恩","text":"天际云收日正晴，阶前花映纸窗明。\n欲沽春酒榆钱小，为绾东风柳线轻。\n坐久忽看移树影，吟高偶觉和禽声。\n诗成浑未思工拙，不为閒争旦夕名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小亭静坐","author":"缪公恩","text":"艳影香风匝小亭，吟馀书竟对虚屏。\n更无人事生烦扰，自有天机见性灵。\n瘦绿肥红皆妙道，落花啼鸟共忘形。\n爱他止水澄波静，閒倚雕阑望渌渟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其一 垂钓图","author":"缪公恩","text":"门对空江水接天，翠屏倒影浸云烟。\n一竿风月无人管，閒数沙鸥倚钓船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":12532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]